# Setup negatives: bad role / unsupported curve / wrong key length.

SPAKE2+ setup rejects key of wrong length (P-256 HMAC)
spake2p_setup_negative:MBEDTLS_ECP_DP_SECP256R1:MBEDTLS_MD_SHA256:MBEDTLS_SPAKE2P_MAC_HMAC:"bb8e1bbcf3c48f62c08db243652ae55d3e5586053fca77102994f23ad95491b3":MBEDTLS_ERR_ECP_BAD_INPUT_DATA

SPAKE2+ setup rejects unsupported curve (Curve25519)
spake2p_setup_negative:MBEDTLS_ECP_DP_CURVE25519:MBEDTLS_MD_SHA256:MBEDTLS_SPAKE2P_MAC_HMAC:"bb8e1bbcf3c48f62c08db243652ae55d3e5586053fca77102994f23ad95491b37e945f34d78785b8a3ef44d0df5a1a97d6b3b460409a345ca7830387a74b1dba":MBEDTLS_ERR_ECP_FEATURE_UNAVAILABLE

# Prover key-share output rejects too-small buffer (P-256 HMAC).

SPAKE2+ Prover key-share buffer too small (P-256)
spake2p_prover_share_buffer_too_small:"bb8e1bbcf3c48f62c08db243652ae55d3e5586053fca77102994f23ad95491b37e945f34d78785b8a3ef44d0df5a1a97d6b3b460409a345ca7830387a74b1dba":"d1232c8e8693d02368976c174e2088851b8365d0d79a9eee709c6a05a2fad539"

# SPAKE2+ Verifier (server) key-share known-answer tests with a fixed ephemeral
# scalar y, injected through mbedtls_spake2p_write_key_share_with_ephemeral().
#
# Arguments: curve, hash, mac, context, idProver, idVerifier, server key
# (w0||L), y, expected shareV. Every row is an official RFC 9383 Appendix C
# test vector: shareV = y*P + w0*N.

SPAKE2+ Verifier key-share KAT P-256 HMAC-SHA256 (RFC 9383 Appendix C)
